        "description": "Normal brain MRI findings excluding structural causes",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of recurrent febrile seizures and generalized tonic-clonic seizures with or without positive family history",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical and supported by exclusion of other epilepsy syndromes"
